  "word_count": 645,
  "body_markdown": "Skip to content\n\nDental Implants\n\nDental Implant Surgery\n\nAll-on-4 Dental Implants\n\nFixed Teeth vs. Removable\n\nCost & Compare\n\nDental Implant FAQ\n\nAesthetics\n\nCosmetic Dentistry\n\nPorcelain Veneers\n\nDental Crowns & Bridges\n\nSmile Makeover\n\nTeeth Whitening\n\nTreatments\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nOral Surgery\n\nEmergency Dentistry\n\nConditions We Treat\n\nWhat To Expect\n\nPatient Center\n\nInsurance & Financing\n\nSmile Gallery\n\nWho We Are\n\nWhy Choose Us\n\nMeet Dr. Esam Nahlah\n\nMeet The Team\n\nVideo Library\n\nPatient Stories\n\nFor Doctors\n\nReferral Form\n\nContact Us\n\nBlog\n\nCurrent Patients\n\nTysons Corner: (703) 448-3312\n\nAlexandria: (703) 940-5410\n\nNew Patients\n\nTysons Corner: (571) 619-9442\n\nAlexandria: (571) 410-3430\n\nBook now\n\n\n## Book Now\n\n\n\n## Book Now\n\n\n\n# Patient Testimonials - McLean, VA\n\n\n\n## Our Patients tell the story best\n\n\nSchedule Now\n\n\n# Patient Testimonials - McLean, VA\n\n\n\n## Our Patients tell the story best\n\n\n\n## Share Your Review\n\n\nDr. Esam Nahlah always appreciates feedback from his valued patients. To date, we’re thrilled to have collected numerous reviews with an average rating of 5 out of 5 stars. Please read what others are saying about Dr. Esam Nahlah below, and as always, we would love to collect your feedback.\n\nRead Our Google Reviews\n\n\n## Our Patients Tell The Story Best\n\n\nAt Dental Group of Tysons, every patient is seen as an individual, and we view your dental needs as such. Your treatment plan is customized just for you. Dr. Nahlah produces nothing less than dental excellence tailored to your needs. Our patients notice and appreciate our focus being on them. Just listen to what a few of them have to say.\n\nMelanie's Testimonial\n\nYolanda's Testimonial\n\nStephen's Testimonial\n\nDonita's Testimonial\n\nA Couple's Testimonial\n\n\"Dr.Nahlah's Patient Testimonials 2\"\n\n\"Barbara's Testimonial\"\n\n\n## You are welcome here.\n\n\nSchedule your new patient appointment today.\n\nBook Now\n\nFacebook Instagram Youtube Google\n\n\n#### Contact Us\n\n\nAddresses:\n\nTysons Corner\n\n7901 Jones Branch Dr., Suite 220\n\nMcLean, VA 22102\n\nNew Patients: (571) 619-9442\n\nCurrent Patients: (703) 448-3312\n\nAlexandria\n\n2855 Duke St,\n\nAlexandria, VA 22314\n\nNew Patients: (571) 410-3430\n\nCurrent Patients: (703) 940-5410\n\n\n#### Hours\n\n\nMonday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nTuesday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nWednesday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nThursday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nFriday: 8:00am – 2:00pm\n\nSaturday: Closed\n\nSunday: Closed\n\n\n#### Services\n\n\nAll-On-4® Implants\n\nCrowns & Bridges\n\n\n#### About Us\n\n\nMeet the Doctor\n\nAbout Us\n\nBefore & After Photos\n\n2025 Dr. Nahlah. All rights reserved",
